OL,3,GNEWSA'We were target of sinister
OL,4,Aheating oil theft and want to warn
OL,5,Aothers'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe head of a rural community charity
OL,8,Fhas warned of the growing risk of home
OL,9,Fheating oil theft after her own
OL,10,Forganisation fell victim to thieves.
OL,12,FKate Clifford, director of the Rural
OL,13,FCommunity Network (RCN), arrived at the
OL,14,Fcharity's offices one morning to find
OL,15,Fthe heat was not working.
OL,17,F"We initially thought there must be a
OL,18,Fleak, but then we could see damage to
OL,19,Fthe tank and knew something was
OL,20,Fseriously wrong," she said.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
