OL,3,GNEWSA'We were target of sinister
OL,4,Aheating oil theft and want to warn
OL,5,Aothers'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe charity had only recently filled
OL,8,Fits tank with more than 1,000 litres of
OL,9,Foil which police later confirmed had
OL,10,Fbeen stolen.
